0..79 Comment "// Univalence over the user universe, after the HoTT book\'s § 2.10 and cubical"
80..146 Comment "// Agda\'s `Cubical/Foundations/Univalence.agda`. `ua(e)` makes the"
147..216 Comment "// bi-invertible map `e : A ≃ B` between two types of `Type` a path"
217..297 Comment "// `Path(Type, A, B)`, admitted on the record\'s two laws as its evidence, at any"
298..372 Comment "// two codes: two variables, or a path type and a presented type, which no"
373..450 Comment "// finite round-trip coverage reaches. Transport along it applies the map, by"
451..522 Comment "// conversion (cubical\'s `uaβ`). Transport along a path between types,"
523..597 Comment "// packaged as the record, is `idtoequiv` (the book\'s `idtoeqv`, cubical\'s"
598..668 Comment "// `pathToEquiv`); `ua` and `idtoequiv` make a quasi-inverse and so an"
669..746 Comment "// equivalence, `univalence`, on two owed laws: `ua` after `idtoequiv`, which"
747..820 Comment "// no rule converts, and `idtoequiv` after `ua`, which needs the record\'s"
821..861 Comment "// inverses to be determined by its map."
863..934 Comment "// The circle, the presented integers, the winding number and spinning."
935..941 Keyword "import"
942..943 StringLit "\""
943..962 StringLit "./circle-base.gandr"
962..963 StringLit "\""
964..965 Other ";"
